{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/f804058409e6a4fdf0afbab59a7bdb2f.avif?t=1759734307\" width=1080 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach the storm and deliver peace to the skies in this  party-based deckbuilder with roguelite storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck for each character, navigate the sky islands and resonate with your party to overcome the odds stacked against them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[DISCLAIMER: VISUALS SUBJECT TO CHANGE]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new spin on turn-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.poster.avif?t=1759734307\" width=616 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.webm?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.mp4?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character draws cards from their own deck on their turn, but characters can be advanced or delayed to achieve a <i><strong>resonance turn</strong></i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this, they gain more tactical variety and activate enhanced abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new combos as you freely weave each deck together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your favourite characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.poster.avif?t=1759734307\" width=616 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.webm?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.mp4?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique cards and mechanics and their turn order can differ each run. Adjust their role and build accordingly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards and events can be discovered depending on the party composition leading to new challenges and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than a node map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way forward isn't as simple as you might think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your  royal airship, The Helmholtz, not only between different procedurally generated nodes but also between different islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islands have unique traits and environments that may help or hinder your plans\u00a0to reach the eye of the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an endlessly replayable sequence of sky islands, as they are swirled into a new formation each run, leading to new revelations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble up to 10 different combinations of characters for your party and enjoy endlessly different deckbuilding approaches with hundreds of cards to experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a new dynamic turn-based combat system leading to unexpected advantages and combos when resonating with your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through different island environments that bring their own challenges and rewards each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose party-enhancing artifacts or character-specific gadgets and uncover different tactics with new cards and encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich lore to piece the world together and learn more about each character</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938910?t=1759734307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/80d7673b21c420b21be4f6d16ee3b71d7f3d1daf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759734307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/919e817a8a33ed9ea6b3f748e7a12caa84c873cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759734307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/919e817a8a33ed9ea6b3f748e7a12caa84c873cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759734307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/f804058409e6a4fdf0afbab59a7bdb2f.avif?t=1759734307\" width=1080 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach the storm and deliver peace to the skies in this  party-based deckbuilder with roguelite storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck for each character, navigate the sky islands and resonate with your party to overcome the odds stacked against them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[DISCLAIMER: VISUALS SUBJECT TO CHANGE]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new spin on turn-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.poster.avif?t=1759734307\" width=616 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.webm?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/a6649f0bb147be853b58ee97006fe85d.mp4?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character draws cards from their own deck on their turn, but characters can be advanced or delayed to achieve a <i><strong>resonance turn</strong></i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this, they gain more tactical variety and activate enhanced abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new combos as you freely weave each deck together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your favourite characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.poster.avif?t=1759734307\" width=616 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.webm?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/38d05ba7f2429da16ecd5ceb0d19040a.mp4?t=1759734307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique cards and mechanics and their turn order can differ each run. Adjust their role and build accordingly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards and events can be discovered depending on the party composition leading to new challenges and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than a node map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way forward isn't as simple as you might think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your  royal airship, The Helmholtz, not only between different procedurally generated nodes but also between different islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islands have unique traits and environments that may help or hinder your plans\u00a0to reach the eye of the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an endlessly replayable sequence of sky islands, as they are swirled into a new formation each run, leading to new revelations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble up to 10 different combinations of characters for your party and enjoy endlessly different deckbuilding approaches with hundreds of cards to experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a new dynamic turn-based combat system leading to unexpected advantages and combos when resonating with your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through different island environments that bring their own challenges and rewards each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose party-enhancing artifacts or character-specific gadgets and uncover different tactics with new cards and encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich lore to piece the world together and learn more about each character</p></li></ul>","developers":["Magonia Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/867264cbfdb265931b56a49e9733dbe796559d3f/header.jpg?t=1759734307","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],